# Runtime Architecture Diagram

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Executor
    participant Scheduler
    participant Dispatcher
    participant Registry
    
    User->>Executor: Submit TaskSpec(task_fn, priority)
    
    Note over Executor,Scheduler: Task enters scheduler pipeline
    
    Executor->>Scheduler: submit(spec)
    Scheduler->>Scheduler: Validate task spec
    Scheduler->>Registry: Check dependencies
    
    alt Dependencies satisfied
        Scheduler->>Scheduler: Place in ReadyQueue
        
        opt Scheduling cycle
            Scheduler->>Dispatcher: select_ready_task()
            Dispatcher->>Dispatcher: Create ExecutionContext
            
            Dispatcher->>Executor: dispatch(task, context)
            
            Note over Executor: Execute task_fn with args/kwargs
            
            Executor->>Executor: Run task function
            Executor->>Registry: Update status
            
            Executor-->>Dispatcher: TaskResult(value/error)
            Dispatcher-->>Scheduler: Result stored
            
        end
        
    else Dependencies pending
        Scheduler->>Scheduler: Place in WaitingQueue
        Scheduler->>Dispatcher: Wait for dependency completion
    end
    
    alt Cancellation requested
        User->>Executor: Cancel(task_id)
        Executor->>Executor: Send cancellation token
        Executor->>Registry: Mark as cancelled
    end
    
    opt Cleanup phase
        Dispatcher->>Dispatcher: Execute cleanup hooks (reverse order)
        Dispatcher->>Registry: Emit TaskEvent(CLEANUP_COMPLETED)
    end
    
    Registry-->>User: TaskResult with timing and status
```

