## Runtime Architecture Components

```mermaid
graph TB
    subgraph "Task Submission Layer"
        A1[TaskSpec]
        A2[ExecutionRequest]
    end
    
    subgraph "Scheduler Layer"
        B1[Scheduler]
        B2[ReadyQueue]
        B3[WaitingQueue]
        B4[RetryQueue]
    end
    
    subgraph "Dispatcher Layer"
        C1[Dispatcher]
        C2[ExecutionContextFactory]
    end
    
    subgraph "Executor Layer"
        D1[Executor]
        D2[WorkerPool]
        D3[ThreadedExecutor]
    end
    
    subgraph "Registry Layer"
        E1[RuntimeRegistry]
        E2[ComponentRegistry]
        E3[ServiceRegistry]
    end
    
    subgraph "Observability Layer"
        F1[LoggingManager]
        F2[MetricsManager]
        F3[TraceManager]
    end
    
    A1 -->|submits to| B1
    B1 -->|schedules to| C1
    C1 -->|dispatches to| D1
    D1 -->|uses| D2
    D2 -->|manages| E1
    
    B2 -->|ready tasks| C1
    B3 -->|pending tasks| B2
    B4 -->|retry tasks| B1
    
    E1 -->|monitors by| F1
    E1 -->|tracks by| F2
    E1 -->|traces by| F3
```

