## Lifecycle Flow

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    Start[Bootstrap] --> Init[Initialize Runtime]
    Init --> Setup[Set Up Registries]
    Setup --> Configure[Apply Configuration]
    Configure --> StartUp[Startup Components]
    
    StartUp --> SteadyState{Steady State}
    
    SteadyState -->|Task Submitted| Scheduler[Scheduler Queue]
    Scheduler -->|Ready| Dispatcher[Dispatcher]
    Dispatcher -->|Execute| Executor[Executor Thread Pool]
    Executor -->|Result| Registry[Runtime Registry]
    
    Registry --> Observability[Observability Events]
    
    SteadyState -->|Shutdown Requested| Shutdown[Graceful Shutdown]
    Shutdown --> Cleanup[Cleanup Resources]
    Cleanup --> End[Stopped]
    
    classDef init fill:#e3f2fd
    classDef steady fill:#fff9c4
    classDef shutdown fill:#ffcdd2
    
    class Start,Init,Setup,Configure,StartUp init
    class SteadyState steady
    class Shutdown,Cleanup,End shutdown